    "shortDescription": "Description: 🇮🇳 Happy Independence Day! 🇮🇳 15 August — a day of pride, freedom and patriotism. ❤️🤍💚 Celebrating the spirit of India with the Tiranga, the ocean and a proud salute to our nation. 🇮🇳 Let’s remember the sacrifices of our freedom fighters and celebrate the freedom of our beautiful country. Jai Hind 🇮🇳 Vande Mataram ❤️",
    "fullPrompt": "Create an ultra-realistic professional DSLR fashion/lifestyle photograph using the uploaded reference image as the exact visual reference. SUBJECT & IDENTITY: Preserve the same young male subject’s facial identity, face shape, hairstyle, skin tone, facial features, beard/stubble, body proportions, and overall natural appearance from the reference image. Keep the face highly realistic and photorealistic with authentic skin texture, natural pores, realistic eyes, and subtle facial details.Do not change his identity. EXACT POSE & BODY POSITION: Recreate the same standing pose as the reference. The subject is standing in shallow seawater near the beach, facing the camera with a relaxed expression. His right hand is raised to his forehead in a proper Indian Army-style salute, fingers together and palm angled naturally. His left arm hangs relaxed beside his body. Maintain the same body posture, head angle, hand position, leg position, and camera perspective as the reference. OUTFIT:Keep EXACTLY the same outfit as the reference: - White oversized/lightweight full-sleeve shirt - Shirt slightly open at the upper chest - Sleeves naturally rolled/folded around the forearms - Loose white traditional-style pants/trousers - Silver wristwatch on the left wrist - Minimal accessories - Natural wet/seaside appearance BACKGROUND & COMPOSITION: Create a beautiful realistic ocean/beach background with the subject standing in shallow seawater.Waves should be visible behind and around his legs, with a soft cloudy sky and slightly misty atmospheric conditions. Add a large Indian tricolor flag in the foreground, blurred due to shallow depth of field, flowing diagonally across the lower-left portion of the frame. The flag should clearly contain saffron, white, green and a realistic navy-blue Ashoka Chakra. TEXT / GRAPHIC DESIGN: At the upper portion of the image, add elegant Independence Day typography similar to the reference:“15 AUGUST” “HAPPY” “INDEPENDENCE” “INDIA” “Day” Use a premium patriotic poster design with saffron, white, green and dark-grey typography. Keep the text clean, sharp, centered and professionally integrated into the photograph without covering the subject’s face. CAMERA & IMAGE QUALITY:Professional DSLR photography, Canon EOS R5 / Sony A7R V quality, 85mm portrait lens, f/1.8 aperture, shallow depth of field, creamy natural bokeh, realistic ocean motion, cinematic lighting, HDR, high dynamic range, natural colors, realistic skin texture, razor-sharp subject details, soft background separation, premium fashion photography, ultra-detailed, 8K Ultra HD, photorealistic. COMPOSITION: Vertical 4:5 Instagram portrait ratio.Full-body framing, subject centered slightly toward the right, plenty of negative space above the subject for the Independence Day typography. Match the reference image’s camera distance, perspective, composition, proportions, and overall visual balance. IMPORTANT: Do not change the subject’s identity, face, hairstyle, skin tone, body proportions, pose, or outfit. Keep everything natural and realistic.No artificial-looking face, no extra fingers, no distorted hands, no warped body, no cartoon effect, no excessive skin smoothing, no oversaturation. Final result should look like a professionally edited Independence Day campaign photograph captured with a high-end DSLR, matching the reference image in pose, outfit, composition, quality, and overall aesthetic.",
