    "title": "🇮🇳 Happy Independence Day 2026 | 15 August Special | Proud to Be Indian ❤️ | Independence Day Photo",
    "shortDescription": "🇮🇳 Happy Independence Day 2026! 🇮🇳 15 August — a day to celebrate the freedom, unity and pride of our great nation India. ❤️ This patriotic portrait celebrates the spirit of Indian Independence Day with the Tricolor 🇮🇳, Ashoka Chakra and the feeling of being proud to be an Indian. Jai Hind! 🇮🇳 Vande Mataram! ❤️ Proud to Be Indian! 🇮🇳",
    "fullPrompt": "Ultra-realistic 8K RAW DSLR cinematic portrait of a handsome young South Asian man standing alone at a luxurious grand riverfront promenade, proudly holding a large Indian National Flag stretched wide with both hands at chest level while respectfully looking down at it with a calm, emotional patriotic expression. Face, hairstyle, beard, facial features, and hairline must match the uploaded reference image exactly (100% identity preservation). He wears a crisp white full-sleeve shirt and white trousers, with no sunglasses or accessories. The Indian tricolor features rich saffron, pure white, deep green, and a perfectly centered navy-blue Ashoka Chakra with realistic fabric folds and gentle wind movement. Behind him, a massive Indian National Flag rises majestically across the grand riverfront, clearly visible and naturally waving in the breeze. Elegant riverfront architecture, wide polished promenade, beautiful river, lush greenery, premium landscaped surroundings, subtle city skyline, cinematic depth of field and creamy bokeh. Top-center premium typography: HAPPY INDEPENDENCE DAY, 15 in saffron, tricolor ribbon with Ashoka Chakra, and AUGUST in bold blue. Soft natural daylight, slightly dramatic cloudy sky, HDR, volumetric lighting, 85mm lens, f/1.8, ultra-detailed, hyper-realistic, photorealistic, natural real-camera look, NOT poster-like, NOT CGI, NOT illustration, razor-sharp focus, vibrant natural colors, majestic patriotic atmosphere, award-winning composition.",
