    "fullPrompt": "Create image Y2K-inspired dark flash photography concept. A striking young vampire figure with voluminous dark hair, a neatly trimmed beard, and pale skin. He is wearing an unbuttoned, loose deep red silk\n\nshirt exposing his collarbones, with vivid red eyes in sharp focus. Composition: Three-panel vertical collage with a moody cinematic concept: Top\n\npanel: close portrait, head turned completely in profile to showcase his sharp jawline and the neatly trimmed beard, while his eyes are cut sharply toward the camera with a calculating\n\nlook. Middle panel: extreme close-up focusing on his vivid red eyes reflecting the rectangular softbox shape of the camera flash, with the silhouette of his hand softly blurred in the\n\nforeground. Bottom panel: a side-angle close\n\nportrait, resting his forehead against his own raised hand, looking straight through the camera lens with a heavy, intense, and deeply brooding posture. Lighting & Effects: Strong direct\n\non-camera flash mixed with a subtle warm glow. Defined textures on the skin, beard, and silk fabric. Slight dark reddish and cool undertones. High exposure with a moody, dark atmosphere. Subtle film grain and a soft diffusion effect. Color grading: Cool pale tones with intense red accents from the silk shirt and eyes. Faded vintage look\n\nwith a gothic aesthetic. Photo ratio.",
