    "id": "prompt-1786301123996-k9bb",
    "title": "Ultra-Realistic AI Face Reference Sheet | 100% Identity Lock | 4 Angles",
    "shortDescription": "Professional ultra-realistic facial reference sheet featuring front, left profile, right profile, and back views. Maximum facial detail, natural skin texture, studio lighting, and strict identity consistency based only on the uploaded reference photos.",
    "fullPrompt": "REFERENCE FACE LOCK (HIGHEST PRIORITY)\n\nUse all uploaded reference photos as the ONLY identity reference.\nThe final person must remain 100% identical to the reference photos.\nDo NOT regenerate, beautify, reshape, age, de-age, or modify the face in any way.\n\nPreserve exactly:\n• Face shape\n• Jawline\n• Eyes\n• Nose\n• Lips\n• Beard & moustache\n• Hairline and hairstyle\n• Skin tone\n• Facial proportions\n• Natural facial texture\n• Identity accuracy: 100%\n\nGenerate a professional ultra-realistic facial reference sheet.\n\nSTYLE:\n• Hyper-realistic photography\n• DSLR quality\n• 8K Ultra HD\n• Ultra sharp focus\n• Maximum facial detail\n• Natural skin pores\n• Realistic lighting\n• No AI look\n• No beauty filter\n• No cartoon effect\n• No face distortion\n• Photorealistic\n\nCAMERA:\n• Sony A7R V\n• 85mm f/1.4 GM Lens\n• RAW Photo\n• ISO 100\n• Studio quality\n• HDR\n• Natural color science\n\nBACKGROUND:\n• Pure neutral gray studio background\n• Soft studio lighting\n• Clean professional portrait setup\n\nPOSES (4 Views):\n\n1. Front View\n• Looking directly into camera\n• Neutral expression\n• Perfect symmetry\n• Shoulders straight\n\n\n2. Left Profile\n• Exact 90° left side profile\n• Head perfectly aligned\n• Eyes looking forward\n• Full ear visible\n\n\n3. Right Profile\n• Exact 90° right side profile\n• Same lighting\n• Same expression\n• Full ear visible\n\n\n4. Back View\n• Back of head visible\n• Hair clearly shown\n• Neck and shoulders aligned\n• Same outfit\n\n\n\nOUTFIT:\n• Plain black crew-neck T-shirt\n• No logos\n• No accessories\n• No glasses\n• No cap\n• No jewelry\n\nQUALITY:\n• 8K\n• Ultra HD\n• Hyper-detailed\n• Razor-sharp focus\n• Studio portrait\n• True-to-life colors\n• Professional passport/reference quality\n• Face consistency across all views\n• Identity preservation: 100%",
