    "title": "Ultra-Realistic Studio Portrait | Exact Face Reference Lock",
    "shortDescription": "Photorealistic studio headshot created using the uploaded reference photos as the sole identity reference, with maximum facial identity preservation, natural skin texture, realistic lighting, and a clean neutral-gray background.",
    "fullPrompt": "REFERENCE FACE LOCK (ABSOLUTE HIGHEST PRIORITY)\n\nUse all uploaded reference photos as the ONLY identity reference.\n\nIdentity preservation has absolute priority over composition, quality, lighting, style and aesthetics.\n\nThe final person MUST be the exact same person.\n\nSTRICT IDENTITY RULES\n\nIdentity Match: 100%\nFace Similarity: 100%\nFace Replacement: OFF\nFace Regeneration: OFF\nBeautification: OFF\nRetouching: OFF\nFace Reshaping: OFF\nJawline Editing: OFF\nForehead Editing: OFF\nCheek Editing: OFF\nNose Editing: OFF\nEye Editing: OFF\nLip Editing: OFF\nSkin Smoothing: OFF\nAge Modification: OFF\n\nPreserve EXACTLY\n\n• Face shape\n• Skull proportions\n• Head width\n• Head height\n• Forehead height\n• Hairline\n• Hairstyle\n• Hair volume\n• Hair color\n• Eyebrows\n• Eyes\n• Nose\n• Lips\n• Teeth\n• Beard\n• Mustache\n• Chin\n• Jawline\n• Ears\n• Neck thickness\n• Skin tone\n• Skin texture\n• Facial pores\n• Every natural facial detail\n\nDo NOT make the face slimmer, wider, longer, shorter or more symmetrical.\n\nIMPORTANT\n\nKeep the SAME facial proportions as the reference.\nDo NOT enlarge the forehead.\nDo NOT reduce the jaw.\nDo NOT sharpen the chin.\nDo NOT make the cheeks thinner.\nDo NOT create a different face.\n\nCOMPOSITION\n\nNatural studio headshot.\nFront facing.\nLooking directly into the camera.\nNeutral expression.\nBoth ears visible.\n\nFraming:\nFrom mid chest to slightly above the hair.\nFace occupies only 60–65% of the frame.\nLeave comfortable space around the head.\nDo NOT use an ultra close-up crop.\n\nBACKGROUND\n\nNeutral gray seamless studio background.\nSoft natural background blur.\n\nLIGHTING\n\nSoft professional studio lighting.\nNatural HDR.\nRealistic shadows.\nTrue skin color.\n\nCAMERA\n\nSony A7R V\nSony FE 85mm GM\nRAW\nISO 100\nf/4\nEye-level camera\nNo wide-angle distortion\n\nQUALITY\n\nPhotorealistic\nTrue-to-life\n8K RAW\nMaximum identity preservation\nNatural skin pores\nNo AI face\nNo plastic skin\nNo oversharpening\nNo beauty filter\n\nFINAL RULE\n\nIf there is any conflict between image quality and identity, ALWAYS preserve the original face exactly as shown in the reference photos.",
